To find proj(sub(a))b use algo below: 

		proj(sub(a)b) = ((a*b)/(a*a))*a




---------------------------------------



Let k be abt scalar and a any vector. 

	1) ||ka|| = |k|*||a||

	2) A unit vector (i.e. a vector of length 1) in the direction of a nonzero vector a is given by a/||a||

NOTE: a*a = ||a||² and ||a|| = √a*a)
